<title>UK: UBS adds 200 mln stg to Jan 2007 Eurobond.</title>
<headline>UBS adds 200 mln stg to Jan 2007 Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated fungible bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   UBS (LONDON BRANCH)</p>
<p> AMT   *200 MLN STG   COUPON     8.00	MATURITY    08.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.19     PAY DATE    30.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.35	REOFFER    98.19     SPREAD	+33 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     *ADD-ON TO 250 MLN STG DEAL LAUNCHED 10.DEC.96.</p>
<p>		PAYMENT PLUS 22 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST.</p>
</text>
